<mxCell id="s2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:16px;&quot;&gt;② FGameplayAbilitySpec&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#555;&quot;&gt;技能档案 · : FFastArraySerializerItem&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#999;&quot;&gt;─────────────────────────────&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;▸ Handle: FGameplayAbilitySpecHandle&lt;br&gt;▸ Ability: TObjectPtr&amp;lt;UGameplayAbility&amp;gt; (CDO)&lt;br&gt;▸ Level / InputID: int32&lt;br&gt;▸ SourceObject: TWeakObjectPtr (弱引用)&lt;br&gt;▸ ActiveCount / InputPressed: uint8 (NotReplicated)&lt;br&gt;▸ bActivateOnce: uint8:1 (位域)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=12;arcSize=14;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
